      </entryLinks>
      <profiles>
        <profile name="Watch This!" typeId="ccb3-7790-3139-7975" typeName="Abilities" hidden="false" id="9b4f-1918-5914-f68d">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="e24a-6018-20cf-d76c">The endless arguments of the Blue Scribes often result in petty squabbles about the best way to cast a spell, making them somehow unreliable... In their Shooting phase, before using their second ranged attack, roll a dice. On a 4-6 they proceed as normal. On a 1-3 they will use once again the same power they have just used.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
      <constraints>
        <constraint type="max" value="1" field="selections" scope="force" shared="true" id="f51a-6ae1-cdd9-8c25" includeChildSelections="true" />
      </constraints>
    </selectionEntry>
