          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Models with this gift do not suffer the penalties for charging enemies through cover, but instead fight at their normal Initiative in the ensuing combat. In addition enemy units do not gain their bonus Attacks for charging a unit including one or more models with this gift.</characteristic>
