    <selectionEntry id="a878-d3ce-4e86-d227-d3f7b" name="Brimstone Conflagration" hidden="false" collective="false" type="upgrade">
      <profiles />
      <rules>
        <rule id="1c41-5d56-988a-6e56-d3f7b" name="Malicious Self-immolation" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>At the start of any Fight sub-phase, you can choose for any units of Brimstone Horrors from a Brimstone Conflagration to consume themselves in flame. At the start of the sub-phase, declare how many Brimstone Horrors you wish to sacrifice. For each model you have chosen to sacrifice, inflict D3 S4 AP4 hits wityh the Warpflame special rule on each enemy unit locked in combat with the Brimstone Horrors. Then, remove the sacrificed models from play (you can sacrifice the whole unit if you wish). </description>
        </rule>
        <rule id="bcb0-9093-bfe4-b154-d3f7b" name="Sea of Living Flame" hidden="false">
          <profiles />
          <rules />
          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <description>If an enemy unit makes a successful charge against a unit from a Brimstone Conflagration that is within 9" of its Exalted Flamer of Tzeentch, then all models in the charging unit must immediately take a Dangerous Terrain test.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
      <infoLinks />
      <modifiers />
      <constraints />
      <selectionEntries />
      <selectionEntryGroups>
        <selectionEntryGroup id="8af5-855e-0f9a-89c8-d3f7b" name="Exalted Flamer" hidden="false" collective="false" defaultSelectionEntryId="2230-afd3-3e1f-53bc-d3f7b">
