            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">An Arcane Icon is an Icon of Chaos. In addition, all models in a unit equipped with an Arcane Icon have the Adamantium Will special rule.</characteristic>
