          <infoLinks />
          <modifiers />
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">An icon of fire is an Icon of Chaos. All close combat attacks made by Daemons of Tzeentch in a unit equipped with an icon of fire have the Soul Blaze special rule.</characteristic>
